            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this in a 9X13 pan and then frost the cake with the pudding/pineapple/whipped topping mixture. It is great after it's been refrigerated for a while."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
