            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Travis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made this one several times. It's wonderful. I do leave out the nuts and instead of the cup of water, I used a cup of the syrup frmo the mandarin oranges. Reading one of the other reviews about the oranges sinking to the bottom- if you've never made it before, put the oranges in the mixer and let it pulvurize them into tiny pieces. I don't think they are supposed to be chunky in a pig pickin' cake.",
            "datePublished": "2020-05-20T00:27:08.927Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good. This made a huge cake so I shared with many friends and family. Everyone loved it. As suggested instead of water in cake mix I used the juice from the mandarin oranges.",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-30T05:44:28.583Z"
          },
          {
