            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paula Latto"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I only had one can of oranges so I made up the difference with dried cranberries in orange juice. I zapped them for 15 to 20 seconds in the microwave to reconstitute.\nAwesome frosting I know I will frost it on other baked goods.",
            "datePublished": "2018-09-05T23:31:57.597Z"
