            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Momma J"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had never had this before, it sounded delicious, and simple enough. I omitted the nuts and used the orange juice (not syrup) in the batter instead of water. I found it overly sweet andrather filling. I think i would try the cake again minus the orange slices, and use 1/2 the required vanilla pudding in the topping.",
